ray.{u_2} l) 0 stop) (List.foldl.{u_1, u_2} f init l)","unsafe":false,"value":146,"source":{"code":"/-- Variant of `foldl_toArray` with a side condition for the `stop` argument. -/\n@[simp] theorem foldl_toArray' (f : β → α → β) (init : β) (l : List α)\n    (h : stop = l.toArray.size) :\n    l.toArray.foldl f init 0 stop = l.foldl f init := by\n  subst h\n  rw [foldl_toList]","start":192,"end":197},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}